    {
      "id": "claim_8165c4f1437d4d1c9c34bac674db496c",
      "statement": "BrijioPageActionsConfig carries an optional defaultTabId used as `tabId ?? config.defaultTabId` by the action helpers. In normal operation it is unset, so the per-call tabId (or its absence) governs targeting; the config default is primarily a seam for tests and pinned runtimes.",
