    {
      "id": "claim_08518d53a9464ec4a4e0be4e6d15d480",
      "statement": "navigate_to_url and perform_batch declare an optional tabId in their MCP input schemas and the using-brijio/navigation skills instruct agents to pass it, but the tool wrappers drop tabId during normalization: navigate-to-url-tool.ts normalizeInput returns only url and browserInstanceId, and batch-tool.ts builds its performBatch options without tabId. Until fixed, tabId is reliable for reads and element actions but is a no-op for navigate_to_url and perform_batch (which fall back to the active tab or config.defaultTabId).",
      "evidence": [
