    {
      "id": "claim_8a9f6d5462ef43988a30ebfed2e527bc",
      "statement": "capture_screenshot (ADR 0064) is active-tab only by design: tabs.captureVisibleTab() captures the visible tab in a window, and capturing a background tab would require switching focus (user-disruptive). The tool accepts a tabId but only validates it matches the active tab, erroring with invalid_browser_target otherwise. An agent needing a screenshot of a specific page should open_tab a dedicated tab, bring it to the foreground, and capture it.",
      "evidence": [
